Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:05.14,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now raise your hands up! Sing your dreams out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.21,0:00:08.81,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always stand up! Raise our unyielding flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:12.36,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,So many obstacles are already behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.44,0:00:17.77,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's keep moving forward! Hands up!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.38,0:00:30.74,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,"I'm almost there, just a little further and I'll have the answer."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:27.49,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(82,558)}Translation\N{\fs40}bobthemilkman @ Yibis Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.64,0:00:30.74,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(756,366)}Translation check\N{\fs40}Lord Starfish @ Yibis Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.81,0:00:38.45,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,That's what I believed as I sailed into this new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.19,0:00:34.37,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(92,414)}Initial timing\N{\fs40}FAbian101 @ Yibis Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.86,0:00:38.43,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(808,476)}Timing\N{\fs40}Galaxy 9000
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.49,0:00:45.98,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,That's right, the pieces of our dreams are joined together as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:43.71,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(190,296)}Quality checking\N{\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.75,0:00:45.96,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(180,488)}Soundtracking\N{\fs40}MaideV and Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.01,0:00:54.03,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,We're connected by unwavering bonds, let's head for a bright future!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.01,0:00:48.25,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(844,384)}Raw providing\N{\fs40}OPC-Raws
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.61,0:00:53.05,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(576,350)}Editing\N{\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.11,0:00:58.64,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now raise your hands up! Sing your dreams out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.72,0:01:02.46,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always stand up! Raise our unyielding flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:05.87,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,So many obstacles are already behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.90,0:01:09.88,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's keep moving forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.95,0:01:11.39,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always look up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.43,0:01:13.58,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep your head held high!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.62,0:01:15.02,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always step up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.06,0:01:16.91,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fly over the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.95,0:01:20.50,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Our dreams have been carefully joined together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.54,0:01:24.74,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's head for the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:31.13,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,We drift forward, riding the waves,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.16,0:01:35.36,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,meeting people and saying goodbye, then doing it again,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.40,0:01:39.63,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,all under this flag...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.34,0:01:44.74,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Pain I don't want to forget is kept in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.79,0:01:48.29,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,There was a day when I softly carved it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.37,0:01:51.92,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone take my freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.96,0:01:54.84,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,I grasp it tightly in my hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.87,0:01:59.75,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now raise your hands up! Sing your dreams out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.79,0:02:03.46,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always stand up! Raise our unyielding flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.50,0:02:06.75,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,So many obstacles are already behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.78,0:02:10.91,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's keep moving forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.94,0:02:12.27,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always look up!
